# Force LF line endings for files that get executed or parsed inside Linux
# containers, regardless of the OS/editor used to check this repo out. A
# shell script checked out with CRLF (Git's default on Windows) fails at
# its very first line inside the container: "no such file or directory".
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
